<title>UK: NAB sets A$150 mln December 2000 bond.</title>
<headline>NAB sets A$150 mln December 2000 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Toronto-Dominion.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NATIONAL AUSTRALIA BANK</p>
<p> AMT    A$150 MLN     COUPON     7.50	MATURITY    08.DEC.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.08    PAY DATE    08.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.50	LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA3	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/AU</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  AUSTRALIA TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  1.0	 PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
